      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# TRELLIS.2 MLX — IMAGE CONDITIONING ONLY\n\nThis workflow encodes approved, separately aligned object views with DINOv3.\n\n- Camera order is fixed: 000°, 090°, 180°, 270°.\n- Each view remains a separate image and mask.\n- Output is an MLX safetensors conditioning artifact.\n- Sparse structure, shape, texture, and mesh generation do not run here.\n- Automatic promotion is disabled.\n\nUse approved RGBA images or connect the Load Image masks. The next standalone workflow will consume the conditioning artifact."
      ],
      "color": "#493b1f",
      "bgcolor": "#6a5730",
      "title": "Modular Conditioning Contract"
    },
